2
00:09:02,222 --> 00:09:08,222
No Country for Old Men is a crime, thriller, western film directed by Joel Coen.

3
00:13:33,333 --> 00:13:39,333
Llewelyn Moss stumbles upon dead bodies, $2 million and a hoard of heroin in a Texas desert, but methodical
killer Anton Chigurh comes looking for it, with local sheriff Ed Tom Bell hot on his trail.

4
00:18:04,444 --> 00:18:10,444
The roles of prey and predator blur as the violent
pursuit of money and justice collide.

5
00:22:35,555 --> 00:22:41,555
Anton Chigurh, played by Javier Bardem.

6
00:27:06,666 --> 00:27:12,666
Ed Tom Bell, played by Tommy Lee Jones.

7
00:31:37,777 --> 00:31:43,777
Llewelyn Moss, played by Josh Brolin.

8
00:36:08,888 --> 00:36:14,888
Carson Wells, played by Woody Harrelson.

9
